config TINYUSB
	bool "TinyUSB library"
	depends on MULTITHREADING
	help
	  Enable TinyUSB using the upstream TinyUSB Git submodule and its Zephyr
	  OS adapter. Set TINYUSB_CONFIG_DIR in CMake to the application directory
	  containing tusb_config.h. The application supplies USB configuration,
	  controller drivers, and task scheduling.
